  "generated_model": "##### Parameters\n\n- Let $T = \\{1, 2, \\ldots, 40\\}$ be the set of tasks.\n- Let $P = \\{1, 2, 3\\}$ be the set of CPUs.\n- Let $f_1 = 1.33$ GHz, $f_2 = 2$ GHz, $f_3 = 2.66$ GHz be the frequencies of CPUs 1, 2, and 3, respectively.\n- Let $b_i$ be the number of billions of instructions (BI) for task $i$, as given below:\n\n$\\begin{align*}\nb_1 &= 1.1 \\\\\nb_2 &= 2.1 \\\\\nb_3 &= 3 \\\\\nb_4 &= 1 \\\\\nb_5 &= 0.7 \\\\\nb_6 &= 5 \\\\\nb_7 &= 3 \\\\\nb_8 &= 3.5 \\\\\nb_9 &= 4.4 \\\\\nb_{10} &= 3.8 \\\\\nb_{11} &= 3.5 \\\\\nb_{12} &= 2.8 \\\\\nb_{13} &= 4.1 \\\\\nb_{14} &= 2.9 \\\\\nb_{15} &= 5.4 \\\\\nb_{16} &= 5.8 \\\\\nb_{17} &= 2.6 \\\\\nb_{18} &= 4.9 \\\\\nb_{19} &= 3.4 \\\\\nb_{20} &= 3.6 \\\\\nb_{21} &= 5.6 \\\\\nb_{22} &= 0.9 \\\\\nb_{23} &= 1 \\\\\nb_{24} &= 0.6 \\\\\nb_{25} &= 5.1 \\\\\nb_{26} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{27} &= 5.3 \\\\\nb_{28} &= 5.9 \\\\\nb_{29} &= 4.9 \\\\\nb_{30} &= 3 \\\\\nb_{31} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{32} &= 1.2 \\\\\nb_{33} &= 4 \\\\\nb_{34} &= 1.3 \\\\\nb_{35} &= 5.7 \\\\\nb_{36} &= 3.4 \\\\\nb_{37} &= 2.8 \\\\\nb_{38} &= 2 \\\\\nb_{39} &= 4.8 \\\\\nb_{40} &= 3 \\\\\n\\end{align*}$\n\n- The processing time of task $i$ on CPU $j$ is $p_{ij} = \\dfrac{b_i}{f_j}$ (in seconds).\n\n##### Decision Variables\n\n- $x_{ij} \\in \\{0,1\\}$: $x_{ij} = 1$ if task $i$ is assigned to CPU $j$, $0$ otherwise.\n- $C_{\\max} \\geq 0$: the makespan (completion time of the last task).\n\n##### Objective Function\n\n$\\min C_{\\max}$\n\n##### Constraints\n\n1. **Each task is assigned to exactly one CPU:**\n\n$\\sum_{j=1}^3 x_{ij} = 1 \\quad \\forall i \\in T$\n\n2. **Makespan constraints (completion time on each CPU does not exceed $C_{\\max}$):**\n\n$\\sum_{i=1}^{40} p_{ij} x_{ij} \\leq C_{\\max} \\quad \\forall j \\in P$\n\n3. **Variable domains:**\n\n$x_{ij} \\in \\{0,1\\} \\quad \\forall i \\in T, \\forall j \\in P$\n\n$C_{\\max} \\geq 0$\n\n##### Retrieved Information\n\n{\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"1\": 1.1,\n    \"2\": 2.1,\n    \"3\": 3,\n    \"4\": 1,\n    \"5\": 0.7,\n    \"6\": 5,\n    \"7\": 3,\n    \"8\": 3.5,\n    \"9\": 4.4,\n    \"10\": 3.8,\n    \"11\": 3.5,\n    \"12\": 2.8,\n    \"13\": 4.1,\n    \"14\": 2.9,\n    \"15\": 5.4,\n    \"16\": 5.8,\n    \"17\": 2.6,\n    \"18\": 4.9,\n    \"19\": 3.4,\n    \"20\": 3.6,\n    \"21\": 5.6,\n    \"22\": 0.9,\n    \"23\": 1,\n    \"24\": 0.6,\n    \"25\": 5.1,\n    \"26\": 4.8,\n    \"27\": 5.3,\n    \"28\": 5.9,\n    \"29\": 4.9,\n    \"30\": 3,\n    \"31\": 4.8,\n    \"32\": 1.2,\n    \"33\": 4,\n    \"34\": 1.3,\n    \"35\": 5.7,\n    \"36\": 3.4,\n    \"37\": 2.8,\n    \"38\": 2,\n    \"39\": 4.8,\n    \"40\": 3\n  },\n  \"cpu_frequencies\": {\n    \"1\": 1.33,\n    \"2\": 2,\n    \"3\": 2.66\n  }\n}",
